File: BernsteinSato.info, Node: Top, Next: Alg, Up: (dir)

BernsteinSato -- algorithms for b-functions, local cohomology, and intersection cohomology
******************************************************************************************

Description
===========

B-functions

  * *note bFunction: bFunction, -- b-function
  * *note generalB: generalB_lpList_cmRingElement_rp, -- global generalized
    Bernstein-Sato polynomial
  * *note globalB: globalB_lpIdeal_cmRingElement_rp, -- compute global
    b-function and b-operator for a D-module and a polynomial
  * *note globalBFunction: globalBFunction_lpRingElement_rp, -- global
    b-function (else known as the Bernstein-Sato polynomial)
  * *note globalBoperator: globalBoperator_lpRingElement_rp, -- compute a
    b-operator of a polynomial
  * *note localBFunction: localBFunction_lpRingElement_cmIdeal_rp, -- local
    b-function (a.k.a. the local Bernstein-Sato polynomial)
  * *note factorBFunction: factorBFunction_lpRingElement_rp, -- factorization
    of a b-function
  * *note bFunctionRoots: bFunctionRoots_lpRingElement_rp, -- get roots of a
    b-function
  * *note getIntRoots: getIntRoots_lpRingElement_rp, -- get integer roots of a
    b-function
  * *note paramBpoly: paramBpoly_lpRingElement_cmFile_rp, -- compute the list
    of all possible Bernstein-Sato polynomials for a parametric polynomial
  * *note AnnFs: AnnFs, -- differential annihilator of a polynomial in a Weyl
    algebra
  * *note AnnIFs: AnnIFs_lpIdeal_cmRingElement_rp, -- the annihilating ideal of
    f^s for an arbitrary D-module

Resolutions and Functors

  * *note Dresolution: Dresolution, -- resolution of a D-module
  * *note Dlocalize: Dlocalize, -- localization of a D-module
  * *note WeylClosure: WeylClosure, -- Weyl closure of an ideal
  * *note Ddual: Ddual, -- holonomic dual of a D-module
  * *note Drestriction: Drestriction, -- restriction modules of a D-module
  * *note Dintegration: Dintegration, -- integration modules of a D-module
  * *note DHom: DHom, -- D-homomorphisms between holonomic D-modules
  * *note DExt: DExt, -- Ext groups between holonomic modules
  * *note polynomialExt: polynomialExt, -- Ext groups between a holonomic
    module and a polynomial ring
  * *note rationalFunctionExt: rationalFunctionExt, -- Ext(holonomic D-module,
    polynomial ring localized at the singular locus)

Applications:

  * *note localCohom: localCohom, -- local cohomology
  * *note deRham: deRham, -- deRham cohomology groups for the complement of a
    hypersurface
  * *note polynomialSolutions: polynomialSolutions, -- polynomial solutions of
    a holonomic system
  * *note rationalFunctionSolutions: rationalFunctionSolutions, -- rational
    solutions of a holonomic system
  * *note populateCechComplexCC: populateCechComplexCC_lpIdeal_cmList_rp, --
    Cech complex skeleton for the computation of the characteristic cycles of
    local cohomology modules
  * *note pruneCechComplexCC: pruneCechComplexCC_lpMutableHashTable_rp, --
    reduction of the Cech complex that produces characteristic cycles of local
    cohomology modules
  * *note logCohomology: logCohomology_lpRingElement_rp, -- logarithmic
    cohomology groups in two variables
  * Multiplier Ideals
      * *note lct: lct_lpIdeal_rp, -- compute the log canonical threshold for
        an ideal
      * *note multiplierIdeal: multiplierIdeal_lpIdeal_cmQQ_rp, -- multiplier
        ideal
      * *note isInMultiplierIdeal:
        isInMultiplierIdeal_lpRingElement_cmIdeal_cmQQ_rp, -- multiplier ideal
        membership test
      * *note jumpingCoefficients: jumpingCoefficients_lpIdeal_rp, -- jumping
        coefficients and corresponding multiplier ideals
      * *note hasRationalSing: hasRationalSing_lpList_rp, -- check if a
        complete intersection has at most rational singularities
