      * NI, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,

Description
===========

An extension of *note Dintegration: Dintegration, that computes the integration
complex, integration classes, etc.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_1,x_2,D_1,D_2,WeylAlgebra=>{x_1=>D_1,x_2=>D_2}]                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
