|o2 = ideal (x , D  - 1)                                                      |
|             1   2                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : DintegrationAll(I,{1,0})                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = HashTable{BFunction => (s)                                              |
|               Boundaries => HashTable{0 => | D_2-1 |}                       |
|                                       1 => 0                                |
|               Cycles => HashTable{0 => | 1 |}                               |
|                                   1 => 0                                    |
|               HomologyModules => HashTable{0 => cokernel | D_2-1 |}         |
|                                            1 => 0                           |
|                                                      1                 1    |
|               IntegrateComplex => 0  <-- (QQ[x , D ])  <-- (QQ[x , D ])  <--|
|                                               2   2             2   2       |
|                                   -1                                        |
|                                          0                 1                |
|                               1      2      1                               |
|               VResolution => R  <-- R  <-- R                                |
|                                                                             |
|                              0      1      2                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : HashTable                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| }                                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|0                                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|2                                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

