intersectionCohomology -- intersection cohomology of an irreducible affine variety
**********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        IH I
        intersectionCohomology(I)
        IH^d I
        intersectionCohomology(d,I)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, in the polynomial ring $R$
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Strategy => a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value
        Schreyer, see *note Dintegration(...,Strategy=>...):
        Dintegration_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
      * LocCohomStrategy => a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, default
        value (Walther,), (String, String); see *note
        localCohom(...,Strategy=>...):
        localCohom_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, and *note
        localCohom(...,LocStrategy=>...):
        localCohom_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmLocStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
      * LocStrategy => a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value
        OTW, see *note IHmodule(...,LocStrategy=>...): IHmodule,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, a table including the
        intersection cohomology groups of the irreducible variety Spec($R/I$),
      * a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, the intersection cohomology
        group in degree d

Description
===========

This routine computes the middle intersection cohomology groups of the
irreducible variety defined by $I$ in the affine space Spec($R$).

+------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x,y]                |
|                              |
|o1 = R                        |
|                              |
|o1 : PolynomialRing           |
+------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x^2+y^3)       |
|                              |
|            3    2            |
|o2 = ideal(y  + x )           |
|                              |
|o2 : Ideal of R               |
+------------------------------+
|i3 : intersectionCohomology(I)|
|                              |
|                      1       |
|o3 = HashTable{0 => QQ }      |
|               1 => 0         |
|                              |
|o3 : HashTable                |
+------------------------------+

Caveat
======

Must be over a ring of characteristic 0. The ideal $I$ should have only 1
minimal prime.



