    b-function (else known as the Bernstein-Sato polynomial)
  * *note generalB: generalB_lpList_cmRingElement_rp, -- global generalized
    Bernstein-Sato polynomial
  * *note globalB: globalB_lpIdeal_cmRingElement_rp, -- compute global
    b-function and b-operator for a D-module and a polynomial

